  "<b>On time</b> = graded within a day of falling due (learning cards come back minutes later, so a stricter rule would flag every one of them). <b>Retention</b> = share of gradings that were not <i>Again</i>. Cards, rating distribution and on-time rate follow the period/language filters above; the <b>forgetting curve</b> and <b>retention by group</b> always use every review, and the predicted curve is the FSRS-6 retrievability": "<b>准时</b> = 到期后一天内完成评分（学习卡几分钟后就会再次出现，更严格的标准会把它们全部判为不准时）。<b>保持率</b> = 非<i>忘记</i>评分所占的比例。卡片、评分分布和准时率遵循上方的周期/语言筛选；<b>遗忘曲线</b>和<b>各组记忆保持率</b>始终使用全部复习记录，预测曲线即 FSRS-6 可提取性",
