  "Hover a word for meaning · Dashed cells = Not seen (from the DELE list) · Inflected forms are matched to their base word · Click a level bar to drill down.": "悬停查看词义 · 虚线格 = 未学过（对照 DELE 词表）· 变形词会归并到原形 · 点击级别条可下钻。",
  "Hover a word for meaning · Dashed cells = Not seen (from the German list) · Inflected forms are matched to their base word · Click a level bar to drill down.": "悬停查看词义 · 虚线格 = 未学过（对照德语词表）· 变形词会归并到原形 · 点击级别条可下钻。",
  "Hover a word for meaning · Dashed cells = Not seen (from the Russian list) · Inflected forms are matched to their infinitive · Click a level bar to drill down.": "悬停查看词义 · 虚线格 = 未学过（对照俄语词表）· 变形词会归并到动词原形 · 点击级别条可下钻。",
  "Hover a word for meaning · Dashed cells = Not seen (from the Thai list) · Buckets are by frequency rank (Common Crawl) · Click a level bar to drill down.": "悬停查看词义 · 虚线格 = 未学过（对照泰语词表）· 按频率排名分组（Common Crawl）· 点击级别条可下钻。",
  "Hover a word for reading and meaning · Dashed cells = Not seen (from the OpenJLPT list) · Click a level bar to drill down.": "悬停查看读音与词义 · 虚线格 = 未学过（对照 OpenJLPT 词表）· 点击级别条可下钻。",
  "Hover pronunciation delay (ms)": "悬停发音延迟（毫秒）",
  "How many never-seen cards one day's sessions may introduce. 0 turns new cards off, so you only revise what is already queued.": "每天的学习会话最多引入多少张从未见过的卡。设为 0 表示不引入新卡，只复习队列里已有的内容。",
  "IPADIC": "IPADIC",
  "If this issue persists, please open a": "如果问题持续，请提交一个",
  "Ign": "忽略",
  "Images": "图片",
  "Import": "导入",
  "Import Terms": "导入词条",
  "Import a Bilibili video with its subtitle (SRT / VTT). The subtitles become the book text so you can look up words while the video plays.": "导入 B 站视频及其字幕（SRT / VTT）。字幕会成为书本文本，播放视频时可以查词。",
  "Import a Mokuro manga archive — generated with <a href=\"https://github.com/kha-white/mokuro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">mokuro</a> — as a .zip / .cbz file. (Sample: <code>hanabira_manga_01.mokuro</code> packaged as a zip.)": "导入用 <a href=\"https://github.com/kha-white/mokuro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">mokuro</a> 生成的漫画压缩包，格式为 .zip / .cbz。（示例：<code>hanabira_manga_01.mokuro</code> 打包成的 zip。）",
  "Import a PDF file. The original PDF is shown unchanged, but the words become clickable so you can look them up and highlight them while reading.": "导入 PDF 文件。原样显示 PDF，但其中的文字可点击，阅读时可以查词和标记。",
  "Import a YouTube video with its subtitle (SRT / VTT). The subtitles become the book text so you can look up words while the video plays.": "导入 YouTube 视频及其字幕（SRT / VTT）。字幕会成为书本文本，播放视频时可以查词。",
  "Import a song from NetEase Cloud Music: the audio is downloaded to your library and its LRC lyrics become the book text, synced line by line with playback. VIP / copyright-restricted songs require logging in via Settings first.": "从网易云音乐导入歌曲：音频下载到资料库，LRC 歌词成为书本文本并逐行与播放同步。VIP / 版权受限歌曲需先在设置中登录。",
  "Import a video with its subtitles (SRT / VTT / TXT). Upload the files or paste online URLs — subtitles are pulled to your library, and video under 20 MB is stored locally. No subtitles? Tick Auto-transcribe and the speech is turned into timed subtitles locally.": "导入视频及字幕（SRT / VTT / TXT）。上传文件或粘贴在线链接——字幕会拉取到资料库，20 MB 以下的视频会存到本地。没有字幕？勾选自动转写，语音会在本地转为带时间轴的字幕。",
  "Import an EPUB as a series — each chapter becomes its own book, tagged with the book title, and shown as one aggregated row on the home page. Leave \"Preview & confirm\" checked to review and select chapters before importing.": "把 EPUB 作为系列导入——每章成为一本独立的书，打上书名标签，并在主页显示为一行汇总。保持勾选“预览并确认”可在导入前检查和挑选章节。",
  "Import audio with subtitles (SRT / VTT / TXT). Upload the files or paste online URLs — subtitles are pulled to your library, and audio under 20 MB is stored locally. Supports mp3, m4a, m4b, wav, ogg, opus, aac, flac, webm.": "导入音频及字幕（SRT / VTT / TXT）。上传文件或粘贴在线链接——字幕会拉取到资料库，20 MB 以下的音频会存到本地。支持 mp3、m4a、m4b、wav、ogg、opus、aac、flac、webm。",
