  "Lute includes the Python library <a href=\"https://github.com/buruzaemon/natto-py\">natto-py</a> to interact with MeCab.  natto-py can usually find MeCab automatically, but you <i>may</i> need to set the MECAB_PATH, per <a href=\"https://luteorg.github.io/lute-manual/install/mecab.html#lute-configuration\" target=\"_blank\">the manual</a>.": "Lute 通过 Python 库 <a href=\"https://github.com/buruzaemon/natto-py\">natto-py</a> 与 MeCab 交互。natto-py 通常能自动找到 MeCab，但<i>可能</i>需要设置 MECAB_PATH，见<a href=\"https://luteorg.github.io/lute-manual/install/mecab.html#lute-configuration\" target=\"_blank\">手册</a>。",
  "Lute is released under the MIT License.": "Lute 基于 MIT 许可证发布。",
  "Lute manual": "Lute 手册",
  "Lute supports two MeCab dictionary types: <b>IPADIC</b> (older, widely used, default) and <b>Unidic</b> (newer, more accurate for modern Japanese).": "Lute 支持两种 MeCab 词典：<b>IPADIC</b>（较旧、广泛使用、默认）和 <b>Unidic</b>（较新，对现代日语更准确）。",
  "Lute uses MeCab to parse Japanese, so MeCab needs to be installed on your machine (see notes in <a href=\"https://luteorg.github.io/lute-manual/install/mecab.html\" target=\"_blank\">the manual</a>).": "Lute 用 MeCab 解析日语，因此需要在你的机器上安装 MeCab（见<a href=\"https://luteorg.github.io/lute-manual/install/mecab.html\" target=\"_blank\">手册</a>说明）。",
