  "One row per scored <b>take</b>, from the reading page's shadowing panel and from shadowing review cards alike; summary cards and the trend follow the period/language filters above, while the <b>most stumbled words</b> always use every take. A word is <i>stumbled</i> when a take missed or misread it (at most once per take); these are the words a follow-up repetition pays off for most.": "每次评分过的<b>跟读</b>占一行，来源包括阅读页的跟读面板和跟读复习卡；摘要卡片和趋势遵循上方的周期/语言筛选，而<b>最常卡住的词</b>始终使用全部跟读记录。某次跟读漏读或误读的词即为<i>卡住</i>（每次跟读最多计一次）；这些词最值得安排后续复读。",
